WEBVTT

00:14:27.279 --> 00:14:30.407
OK, you know that I’m going to show up,

00:14:30.407 --> 00:14:33.243
and I’ve got a pep in my high heel,
red-bottom step.

00:14:33.827 --> 00:14:35.954
I do have heaving cleavage.

00:14:36.204 --> 00:14:37.205
(Laughter)

00:14:37.205 --> 00:14:39.625
And I’ve got a tell-it-like-it-is
approach to life

00:14:39.625 --> 00:14:42.502
that’s always dosed with a ladle of love.

00:14:44.212 --> 00:14:46.423
It took me 55 years to get here.

00:14:46.924 --> 00:14:49.176
So, Chris Rock, you’re right.

00:14:49.718 --> 00:14:50.802
I’m a late bloomer.

00:14:51.178 --> 00:14:52.930
And that’s OK.

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.640
Because I’m right on time,

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.225
Because it gets greater later.

00:14:57.476 --> 00:14:58.477
Thank you.

00:14:58.477 --> 00:15:05.442
(Applause and cheers)